WEBVTT

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:10.230
Congratulations, Mother.

00:00:10.230 --> 00:00:11.900
Thank you, Rudy.

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:15.600
Now you won't have to feel lonely anymore.

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:17.060
Way to go, Zenith!

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:19.940
Dear!

00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:23.350
Our family is growing. Way to go, Rudy!

00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:27.100
Zenith has been worrying that
she couldn't have a second child.

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:30.940
So, the Greyrat family was
overjoyed at her pregnancy.

00:00:33.770 --> 00:00:37.850
My humble apologies. I am pregnant.

00:00:41.310 --> 00:00:43.270
"Who's the father?"

00:00:43.270 --> 00:00:46.150
No one could bring themselves to ask.

00:00:46.150 --> 00:00:49.350
Everyone realized instantly.

00:00:49.350 --> 00:00:53.600
S-Sorry! I-It's probably mine.

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:54.850
Pathetic.

00:00:54.850 --> 00:00:58.650
No, as an honest man,
maybe I should compliment him.

00:00:58.650 --> 00:01:04.020
Maybe he couldn't bring himself to lie
because he's always lecturing me.

00:01:04.020 --> 00:01:08.770
Oh, well. I don't hate that side of him.

00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:13.480
This is the worst possible situation, though.

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:42.010
"Mushoku Tensei: Jobless Reincarnation"

00:02:43.520 --> 00:02:45.270
So...

00:02:45.270 --> 00:02:46.850
what will you do?

00:02:46.850 --> 00:02:52.440
After assisting you with childbirth,
My Lady, I plan to take my leave.

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:54.060
And the child?

00:02:54.060 --> 00:02:57.600
I hope to raise it in my hometown.

00:02:57.600 --> 00:03:00.400
That's a month's ride south, isn't it?

00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:02.020
It is.

00:03:02.020 --> 00:03:08.310
You'll be worn out from childbirth.
The long journey will be too much for you.

00:03:10.270 --> 00:03:15.310
Possibly, but I have nowhere else to turn.

00:03:15.310 --> 00:03:17.150
Umm, Zenith, isn't that--

00:03:17.150 --> 00:03:19.480
You be quiet!

00:03:20.560 --> 00:03:25.520
A whole month. A newborn child
and its mother traveling alone.

00:03:25.520 --> 00:03:28.230
I don't know how safe it is outside the village,

00:03:28.230 --> 00:03:31.650
but I doubt they'd make it in one piece.

00:03:31.650 --> 00:03:36.400
Zenith is right. If Lilia collapses,
the baby will die with her.

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:40.600
And even if Lilia is strong enough,
what about the child?

00:03:40.600 --> 00:03:45.480
Can a newborn baby survive a one-month journey?

00:03:45.480 --> 00:03:46.770
Not a chance.

00:03:46.770 --> 00:03:52.480
I can picture Lilia collapsing in
the snow with her baby clear as day.

00:03:55.650 --> 00:03:57.980
Zenith seems conflicted, too.

00:03:57.980 --> 00:04:02.230
Lilia may be a maid, but we've
lived together happily all this time.

00:04:02.230 --> 00:04:06.100
I don't want Lilia to die like that either.

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:08.850
When I'm sweaty, she brings a towel.

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:11.850
When I get rained on, she draws a hot bath.

00:04:11.850 --> 00:04:14.650
On cold nights, she lays out blankets for me.

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:17.770
When I leave books out, she tidies them up.

00:04:17.770 --> 00:04:19.940
And most importantly,

00:04:19.940 --> 00:04:24.650
she knows about the holy relic
but doesn't tell anyone.

00:04:29.270 --> 00:04:32.100
It's time I repaid the favor.

00:04:35.020 --> 00:04:38.730
Mother, I'm going to have two
little brothers or sisters at once.

00:04:38.730 --> 00:04:41.810
So, why is everyone so gloomy?

00:04:41.810 --> 00:04:44.940
Because your father and Lilia did something bad.

00:04:44.940 --> 00:04:46.600
I see.

00:04:46.600 --> 00:04:51.350
But can Lilia say no to Father?

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:52.900
What do you mean?

00:04:52.900 --> 00:04:55.850
Father has a hold over Lilia.

00:04:55.850 --> 00:04:56.650
What?!

00:04:56.650 --> 00:04:57.480
Huh?!

00:04:57.480 --> 00:05:02.480
The other night, when I passed Lilia's
room on my way to the bathroom,

00:05:02.480 --> 00:05:07.190
Father was saying, "Spread your legs
if you don't want it to get out."

00:05:07.190 --> 00:05:08.730
Rudy! What the hell are you--

00:05:08.730 --> 00:05:10.350
You be quiet!

00:05:10.350 --> 00:05:12.310
B-But...

00:05:12.310 --> 00:05:14.810
Lilia, is that true?

00:05:14.810 --> 00:05:17.810
No, absolutely not.

00:05:17.810 --> 00:05:19.230
Oh, I see.

00:05:19.230 --> 00:05:21.190
You can't openly admit it, of course.

00:05:21.190 --> 00:05:24.150
No, I really didn't say anything like...

00:05:24.150 --> 00:05:29.730
Paul helped me out with Sylphie,
but he dug his own grave this time.

00:05:29.730 --> 00:05:32.730
Sorry. I'll repay you for that next time.

00:05:32.730 --> 00:05:35.520
Mother, I don't think Lilia did anything wrong.

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:38.770
It's all Father's fault.

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:40.400
I suppose.

00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:45.650
It's not right for Lilia to suffer
for something Father did wrong.

00:05:45.650 --> 00:05:47.900
I suppose.

00:05:47.900 --> 00:05:51.480
I have fun playing with Sylphie every day.

00:05:51.480 --> 00:05:56.020
Wouldn't it be nice for the
new baby to have a friend, too?

00:05:57.850 --> 00:06:00.310
I suppose.

00:06:02.060 --> 00:06:07.310
Besides, Mother, they'd both
be my brothers or sisters.

00:06:10.600 --> 00:06:12.650
Mother,

00:06:12.650 --> 00:06:16.730
I don't want to say goodbye to Lilia yet.

00:06:21.480 --> 00:06:23.350
All right, fine.

00:06:23.350 --> 00:06:25.850
I can't beat you, Rudy.

00:06:25.850 --> 00:06:28.650
You don't make it easy, <i>Maman</i> .

00:06:28.650 --> 00:06:29.690
Lilia,

00:06:29.690 --> 00:06:31.270
stay here with us.

00:06:31.270 --> 00:06:35.980
You're family now!
I won't let you go off on your own.

00:06:37.150 --> 00:06:39.730
Okay, it should work out fine now.

00:06:39.730 --> 00:06:42.020
Now it's up to Paul's efforts.

00:06:42.020 --> 00:06:44.100
Man, he's such a handful.

00:06:44.100 --> 00:06:47.190
This is your last chance, <i>señor</i> ​.

00:06:47.190 --> 00:06:48.850
Dear,

00:06:48.850 --> 00:06:53.100
we're going to have a nice,
long talk about this later.

00:07:10.400 --> 00:07:14.440
F-Father! Please stop taking it out on me!

00:07:15.690 --> 00:07:18.770
Why was I saved?

00:07:18.770 --> 00:07:21.270
The pregnancy is my fault.

00:07:21.270 --> 00:07:24.060
It was me who seduced Paul.

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:27.690
Oh! Dear!

00:07:27.690 --> 00:07:34.650
Hearing them moaning every single
night gives even a maid pent-up urges.

00:07:36.060 --> 00:07:39.600
I'm honestly amazed I held out this long.

00:08:07.560 --> 00:08:09.900
I deserved to be punished.

00:08:09.900 --> 00:08:14.020
Punished for giving into
desire and betraying Zenith.

00:08:14.020 --> 00:08:18.480
But I was forgiven. Rudeus forgave me.

00:08:18.480 --> 00:08:21.730
That child understood exactly what happened

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:27.730
and guided the conversation
smoothly to a compromise.

00:08:27.730 --> 00:08:30.060
I've avoided him until now.

00:08:30.060 --> 00:08:34.770
I've been frightened. Frightened of Rudeus.

00:08:34.770 --> 00:08:39.270
A baby who stared at
my chest with a repulsive grin.

00:08:39.270 --> 00:08:43.440
He was unnerving. I thought
he might be possessed by a devil.

00:08:43.440 --> 00:08:46.900
No, I'll stop all that now.

00:08:46.900 --> 00:08:52.400
He saved my life. I have to
spend my life repaying him.

00:08:52.400 --> 00:08:56.100
If the child I'm carrying
is born and grows up safely,

00:08:56.100 --> 00:09:01.810
I will have it serve Rudeus-- <i>Lord</i> Rudeus.

00:09:05.350 --> 00:09:10.060
Norn, Aisha, daddy's here!

00:09:11.230 --> 00:09:13.480
Now daddy's gone!

00:09:13.480 --> 00:09:18.850
Every single day. Don't you have
anything better to do, Paul?

00:09:21.600 --> 00:09:22.480
Huh?

00:09:22.480 --> 00:09:24.190
Oh dear.

00:09:25.980 --> 00:09:27.730
It's hard raising children.

00:09:27.730 --> 00:09:30.810
This is it! This is how
parenting is supposed to be!

00:09:30.810 --> 00:09:33.310
You had it too easy with Young Master Rudeus!

00:09:33.310 --> 00:09:34.940
There, there.

00:09:34.940 --> 00:09:38.270
Dear, would you go draw some water?

00:09:38.270 --> 00:09:42.020
Oh, and would you go buy some
more candles while you're at it?

00:09:42.020 --> 00:09:44.270
S-Sure.

00:09:45.400 --> 00:09:50.400
Sylphie, I've decided I want to be
a cool big brother who's looked up to.

00:09:50.400 --> 00:09:51.770
Huh?

00:09:53.520 --> 00:09:58.190
Since that day, Lilia's gradually
started talking to me.

00:09:58.190 --> 00:10:00.270
Surprisingly, when they were younger,

00:10:00.270 --> 00:10:04.310
Lilia and Paul studied swordsmanship together.

00:10:04.310 --> 00:10:08.850
Back then, Paul had talent but
hated practice and goofed off.

00:10:08.850 --> 00:10:13.190
In the end, he assaulted Lilia when
she was sleeping and deflowered her.

00:10:13.190 --> 00:10:15.310
Then, he fled the training hall.

00:10:15.310 --> 00:10:16.850
What a good-for-nothing.

00:10:16.850 --> 00:10:18.600
Rudy!

00:10:18.600 --> 00:10:21.400
It's time for practice!

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:28.650
You'll be Elementary forever
if you keep moving like that.

00:10:28.650 --> 00:10:31.520
Putting it mildly, Paul is scum.

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:35.350
But despite all his faults, I respect this man.

00:10:35.350 --> 00:10:38.190
Why? Because he's strong.

00:10:39.440 --> 00:10:41.400
There are three sword styles:

00:10:41.400 --> 00:10:45.100
Sword God Style, Water God Style,
and North God Style.

00:10:45.100 --> 00:10:48.150
Paul is ranked Advanced in all three.

00:10:52.650 --> 00:10:56.350
Hey, now! That's cheating!

00:10:56.350 --> 00:11:00.560
Hah! You might have a little talent for magic,

00:11:00.560 --> 00:11:03.650
but not for swordplay.

00:11:03.650 --> 00:11:06.020
What are you staring at me for?

00:11:06.020 --> 00:11:09.190
You want to become a cool man like your dad?

00:11:09.190 --> 00:11:14.730
Is it cool to cheat on your wife
and almost wreck your family?

00:11:14.730 --> 00:11:19.730
Well, if you've learned your lesson,
please limit yourself to Mother.

00:11:19.730 --> 00:11:22.650
L-Lilia's fine, right?

00:11:22.650 --> 00:11:27.650
Mother might go back to her
parents' house without a word next time.

00:11:27.650 --> 00:11:29.810
You're a man. You get it, right?

00:11:29.810 --> 00:11:33.020
What is a seven-year-old supposed to "get"?

00:11:33.020 --> 00:11:36.440
Come on, you're all over little Sylphie.

00:11:36.440 --> 00:11:38.900
That girl will be a beauty someday.

00:11:38.900 --> 00:11:43.230
I'm sure she will, although
I think she's plenty cute as she is.

00:11:43.230 --> 00:11:45.060
See? You do get it.

00:11:45.060 --> 00:11:46.310
I guess so.

00:11:46.310 --> 00:11:50.520
Paul is scum, but I can't deny
that we speak the same language.

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:55.940
Mentally, I'm a 40-something bum:
as scummy as it gets.

00:11:55.940 --> 00:11:59.440
Oh, yeah, Rudy, about school...

00:12:00.650 --> 00:12:03.190
Never mind. You won't need it.

00:12:03.190 --> 00:12:04.850
Resume.

00:12:04.850 --> 00:12:05.900
School...

00:12:05.900 --> 00:12:07.600
Huh? Yeah.

00:12:07.600 --> 00:12:11.810
Kids normally start going at around your age.

00:12:11.810 --> 00:12:13.400
I know that.

00:12:13.400 --> 00:12:17.400
Do you need it? You can already
read, write, and do arithmetic.

00:12:17.400 --> 00:12:19.150
Well, yes.

00:12:20.980 --> 00:12:23.650
Still, school, huh?

00:12:23.650 --> 00:12:25.440
Are you interested?

00:12:25.440 --> 00:12:27.940
Hah! Forget about it!

00:12:27.940 --> 00:12:30.600
It's full of spoiled rich kids.

00:12:30.600 --> 00:12:34.770
A kid like you would get bullied for sure.

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:41.230
Besides, the girls in those places
never exercised a day in their lives.

00:12:41.230 --> 00:12:46.650
Once you get them out of their
clothes and into bed, they're a mess.

00:12:46.650 --> 00:12:49.690
I've gotten fooled too many times.

00:12:49.690 --> 00:12:52.270
Really? That's a shame.

00:12:52.270 --> 00:12:54.600
I hoped there might be cute girls.

00:12:54.600 --> 00:12:57.980
Oh, are you getting interested in women?

00:12:57.980 --> 00:13:02.480
But you're better off
picking just one ass to chase.

00:13:03.900 --> 00:13:05.520
All right.

00:13:13.350 --> 00:13:16.100
Sylphie has talent.

00:13:16.100 --> 00:13:19.980
She might surpass me before much longer.

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:22.020
School, huh?

00:13:22.020 --> 00:13:26.020
What should we do today, Rudy?

00:13:26.020 --> 00:13:26.980
Rudy?

00:13:26.980 --> 00:13:28.810
Oh, sorry. What?

00:13:28.810 --> 00:13:31.480
You've been weird again lately, Rudy.

00:13:31.480 --> 00:13:34.560
They say I've been weird since I was born.

00:13:34.560 --> 00:13:38.350
That's not what I mean. You seem kind of down.

00:13:38.350 --> 00:13:43.230
I've been stuck lately. I'm not making
progress with swords or magic.

00:13:43.230 --> 00:13:45.730
But you're amazing, Rudy.

00:13:45.730 --> 00:13:48.850
Maybe for my age.

00:13:50.230 --> 00:13:52.400
Are you going to leave?

00:13:52.400 --> 00:13:58.270
Maybe. There might not be
much I can do in this village.

00:14:02.520 --> 00:14:05.100
S-Sylphiette?

00:14:05.100 --> 00:14:07.850
No, don't!

00:14:07.850 --> 00:14:12.400
D-Don't! Don't go anywhere.

00:14:16.060 --> 00:14:18.810
All right. I understand.

00:14:18.810 --> 00:14:20.480
I won't go anywhere.

00:14:20.480 --> 00:14:24.400
Why would I go away and
leave a girl like her behind?

00:14:24.400 --> 00:14:27.020
To improve my magic?

00:14:27.020 --> 00:14:29.770
What do I need to do more of that for?

00:14:29.770 --> 00:14:33.560
I'd rather spend my time
peacefully with Sylphie in this village.

00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:36.400
Yeah, that's just what I'll do.

00:14:36.400 --> 00:14:42.060
We'll grow up together, and I'll gradually
raise her to be my ideal woman.

00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:43.650
Sylphie!

00:14:43.650 --> 00:14:45.400
Hey, Rudy!

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:49.480
If you don't want anything, please leave!

00:14:49.480 --> 00:14:52.190
You've got a letter.

00:14:49.480 --> 00:14:52.190
Jeez!

00:14:52.190 --> 00:14:54.190
A letter?

00:14:54.190 --> 00:14:56.150
Dear Rudeus,

00:14:56.150 --> 00:14:58.150
how have you been?

00:14:58.150 --> 00:15:02.770
It's been two years since
we parted ways. How time flies.

00:15:02.770 --> 00:15:06.690
I am currently staying in the Shirone Kingdom.

00:15:06.690 --> 00:15:10.270
I've been hired as the seventh prince's tutor.

00:15:10.270 --> 00:15:12.900
His Highness is a lot like you.

00:15:12.900 --> 00:15:18.980
He learns magic quickly, although
not as quickly as you, and he's clever.

00:15:18.980 --> 00:15:24.310
He also spies on me when I'm changing
and steals my panties just like you.

00:15:24.310 --> 00:15:27.350
They do say great men have great lusts.

00:15:27.350 --> 00:15:29.690
Got you!

00:15:34.060 --> 00:15:39.350
Oh, yes, I finally succeeded in
mastering King-Class water magic.

00:15:39.350 --> 00:15:43.940
I thought I'd reached my limit,
but I just needed to try harder.

00:15:43.940 --> 00:15:48.940
I suppose you may have mastered
Emperor-Class magic by now.

00:15:45.980 --> 00:15:48.270
What are you doing? This is lèse-majesté!

00:15:48.270 --> 00:15:51.020
You'll pay for this! Let me touch your butt!

00:15:48.940 --> 00:15:52.600
I'm excited, and a little
scared, to see you again.

00:15:51.020 --> 00:15:52.350
Come on, let me rub it!

00:15:52.350 --> 00:15:55.150
I'll do it if you don't say anything!

00:15:52.600 --> 00:15:55.150
I'll work hard to keep up with you.

00:15:55.150 --> 00:16:00.150
I doubt I need to worry,
but if you're struggling with magic,

00:16:00.150 --> 00:16:04.270
please seek admission to Ranoa Magic
University, which I told you about.

00:16:04.270 --> 00:16:06.980
Goodbye. I'll write to you again.

00:16:06.980 --> 00:16:08.730
Roxy.

00:16:08.730 --> 00:16:09.940
Master...

00:16:09.940 --> 00:16:15.100
Wow, Roxy finally made it to
Water King Class. I'm impressed.

00:16:15.100 --> 00:16:16.560
Is it that impressive?

00:16:16.560 --> 00:16:18.100
It sure is.

00:16:18.100 --> 00:16:25.230
You could count all the King-Class mages
in the world on one hand, I'll bet.

00:16:25.230 --> 00:16:27.100
By the way...

00:16:27.100 --> 00:16:29.270
you stole Roxy's panties?

00:16:29.270 --> 00:16:30.650
Crap!

00:16:32.480 --> 00:16:35.850
That brought home just
how pathetic my situation is.

00:16:35.850 --> 00:16:40.190
Damn it. I don't want to disappoint Roxy.

00:16:41.270 --> 00:16:44.730
Ranoa Magic University, huh?

00:16:51.770 --> 00:16:53.230
Father,

00:16:53.230 --> 00:16:55.600
may I make an unreasonable request?

00:16:55.600 --> 00:16:57.350
No.

00:16:57.350 --> 00:16:59.150
Ask for anything, Rudy.

00:16:59.150 --> 00:17:01.270
Your father will manage it somehow.

00:17:01.270 --> 00:17:05.230
This is a test of your dignity
and resourcefulness, My Lord.

00:17:05.230 --> 00:17:07.440
Rudy even put a disclaimer on it.

00:17:07.440 --> 00:17:10.440
It's definitely more than I can mana--

00:17:10.440 --> 00:17:13.690
You see, I haven't been improving lately.

00:17:13.690 --> 00:17:17.810
So, I want to enroll in Ranoa Magic University.

00:17:17.810 --> 00:17:18.980
Oh?

00:17:18.980 --> 00:17:23.400
But when Sylphie caught wind of that,
she cried that she didn't want me to go.

00:17:23.400 --> 00:17:26.850
You little charmer.
I wonder who you get that from.

00:17:26.850 --> 00:17:29.650
I was hoping we could both enroll together,

00:17:29.650 --> 00:17:33.270
but her family isn't as well-off as ours.

00:17:33.270 --> 00:17:37.810
So, I was hoping you could
pay tuition for both of us.

00:17:37.810 --> 00:17:38.940
Please.

00:17:38.940 --> 00:17:43.020
You want to go to Ranoa together?

00:17:43.020 --> 00:17:44.730
No.

00:17:47.270 --> 00:17:49.400
There are several reasons.

00:17:49.400 --> 00:17:51.810
First, you're learning the sword.

00:17:51.810 --> 00:17:55.520
As your teacher, I can't let you go now.

00:17:55.520 --> 00:17:58.520
Also, you're smart but still young.

00:17:58.520 --> 00:18:01.810
I can't neglect my parental responsibilities.

00:18:01.810 --> 00:18:03.650
Then, there's the money.

00:18:03.650 --> 00:18:07.690
Just you would be one thing,
but we can't pay for Sylphie, too.

00:18:07.690 --> 00:18:11.230
Our money doesn't grow on trees either.

00:18:11.230 --> 00:18:14.600
I see. I understand.

00:18:14.600 --> 00:18:16.560
May I ask for one thing, then?

00:18:16.560 --> 00:18:17.730
Sure.

00:18:17.730 --> 00:18:21.730
Please find me a job. As well-paid as possible.

00:18:21.730 --> 00:18:24.520
A job? What for?

00:18:24.520 --> 00:18:27.150
By the time you decide I'm ready to leave home,

00:18:27.150 --> 00:18:29.980
I'll earn Sylphie's tuition myself.

00:18:29.980 --> 00:18:32.690
That won't be the best thing for Sylphie.

00:18:32.690 --> 00:18:37.020
Yes, but I think it will be for me.

00:18:43.060 --> 00:18:48.650
Fine. If that's how it is,
I'll see what I can do.

00:18:48.650 --> 00:18:50.810
Thank you very much!

00:19:07.060 --> 00:19:08.560
Oh?

00:19:17.350 --> 00:19:20.600
Hey. Long time no see, Ghislaine.

00:19:26.690 --> 00:19:28.310
Yeah.

00:19:29.690 --> 00:19:32.520
A-A beast person!

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:34.770
Ghislaine!

00:19:34.770 --> 00:19:37.230
It's been ages. Have you been well?

00:19:37.230 --> 00:19:38.440
Yeah.

00:19:38.440 --> 00:19:39.900
That your kid?

00:19:39.900 --> 00:19:42.650
Yes, this is Norn.

00:19:42.650 --> 00:19:45.810
Good thing she doesn't take after Paul.

00:19:45.810 --> 00:19:50.100
Since you're here, I guess that
means everything's good to go?

00:19:50.100 --> 00:19:51.310
Yeah.

00:19:51.310 --> 00:19:53.520
Take care of our Rudeus.

00:19:53.520 --> 00:19:55.690
Sure.

00:19:55.690 --> 00:19:58.270
Young Master Rudeus.

00:19:58.270 --> 00:20:01.190
We'll miss you.

00:20:01.190 --> 00:20:02.350
Take care.

00:20:02.350 --> 00:20:05.940
We'll be looking forward to your return.

00:20:05.940 --> 00:20:07.480
Hang on, what are you--

00:20:07.480 --> 00:20:09.600
Hey, Rudy.

00:20:09.600 --> 00:20:11.690
Yes? What is it?

00:20:11.690 --> 00:20:16.810
If I told you to stay away from
Sylphie, how would you feel?

00:20:16.810 --> 00:20:20.150
Huh? I wouldn't want to, obviously.

00:20:20.150 --> 00:20:21.480
I figured.

00:20:21.480 --> 00:20:23.980
What's going on?

00:20:23.980 --> 00:20:26.100
Oh, nothing.

00:20:26.100 --> 00:20:30.310
If I tried to explain,
you'd just argue your way out.

00:20:32.770 --> 00:20:34.730
Whoa!

00:21:09.810 --> 00:21:11.900
Water God Style!

00:21:14.310 --> 00:21:16.690
I'm glad it's a wooden sword.

00:21:32.190 --> 00:21:33.480
Ow.

00:21:33.480 --> 00:21:36.230
What the hell, Paul?

00:21:41.440 --> 00:21:43.440
What happened?

00:21:43.440 --> 00:21:47.600
Hello. My name is Rudeus Greyrat.

00:21:47.600 --> 00:21:51.980
You're awfully polite for Paul's son.

00:21:51.980 --> 00:21:53.690
Am I?

00:21:53.690 --> 00:21:57.980
I'm Ghislaine. Starting tomorrow,
we work together.

00:21:57.980 --> 00:22:00.190
Nice to meet you.

00:22:00.190 --> 00:22:03.270
It will be my pleasure.

00:22:09.010 --> 00:22:12.010
Episode 4

00:22:09.010 --> 00:22:12.010
Emergency Family Meeting

00:23:42.020 --> 00:23:47.030
Next time

00:23:42.480 --> 00:23:47.030
A Young Lady and Violence
